  "ruleText": "Pda 101.03 “Authority” means “authority” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, V, namely “the Pease development authority.\n\nSource. #7847, eff 3-8-03; ss and moved by #8760, eff 11-18-06 (from Pda 101.02)",
